## Planning Complete — Day 148

### Summary

The session plan addresses the root cause of the 4+ session empty streak (Days 145-147) and adds diagnostic coverage.

| Task | File | Issue | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| task_01 | scripts/preseed_session_plan.py | none | CRITICAL: Fix _check_code_already_exists() false contradiction detection — restricts check to src/*.rs so task keywords in the script's own TASKS constants don't self-sabotage planning |
| task_02 | scripts/preseed_session_plan.py | #135 | Wire _healthy_codebase_fallback() into no-candidates path when analysis-only pressure is active — breaks the self-referential planning-fix cycle |
